  "instructions": [
    "1. Heat the ghee or oil in the skillet over medium heat.",
    "2. Add the cumin powder, coriander powder, and garam masala. Cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "3. Add the softened brie cheese and stir until melted and smooth.",
    "4. Stir in the Greek yogurt until well combined.",
    "5. Season with salt to taste.",
    "6. Reduce heat to low and simmer for 5 minutes.",
    "7. Serve hot, garnished with fresh herbs if desired."
